{0 awskit-s3-lwt}

Generic Lwt adapter for Awskit S3.

The public entrypoint is {!module:Awskit_s3_lwt}. This package connects the
runtime-neutral {!module:Awskit_s3} operation surface to a caller-supplied
Awskit Lwt runtime.

Use it when an application needs a custom Lwt HTTP backend. Use the
[awskit-s3-lwt-unix] package when the ready Lwt + Unix S3 client is enough.
